// Naive — the one-expert Project mission (43.21 task 1). It performs direct, single-expert
// reasoning: no negotiation, no approval step, and no tool.
//
// It is deliberately NOT a small Janus, and it is deliberately not a fallback either — a person
// picks it by name because they want a plain answer rather than a reviewed one. It has one expert,
// no `role: agent`, and its runner is invoked with no tool declarations, so it cannot request a
// tool, touch a file, or run a command.
//
// This asset replaces the former MissionControl mission. Until 43.21 task 3 removes the legacy
// route, the Worker also resolves the old `MissionControl` key to this same asset rather than
// keeping a second, near-identical copy checked in.

mission Naive(projectGoal, task) = {
    Controller
}

output(Naive)
